  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.5 - Complete Refactor for Simplicity\n• REFACTORED: Complete rewrite of Hangfire integration\n• SIMPLIFIED: Cleaner architecture with immediate monitor syncing\n• NEW: MonitoredRecurringJobManager for automatic sync on job registration\n• NEW: Extension methods that sync monitors when called\n• REMOVED: Complex discovery code and delayed syncing\n• FIXED: Monitors now created reliably when jobs are registered",
